{"unit_id":"Mizumic__dsh-system-fingerprint#feature-1","repo":"Mizumic/dsh-system-fingerprint","commit":"4286e01e6e1f621fe09c03f79b2c4d6c36860037","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-system-fingerprint 的「会话检查点徽标」：在会话标题栏显示当前 DeepSeek 路由的检查点名称或原始 system_fingerprint。页面定期更新，点击徽标可强制重新探测并查看模型与端点详情。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:680-730","lib/index.js:1949-2045"]}
{"unit_id":"Mizumic__dsh-system-fingerprint#feature-2","repo":"Mizumic/dsh-system-fingerprint","commit":"4286e01e6e1f621fe09c03f79b2c4d6c36860037","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-system-fingerprint 的「网关路由溯源」：真实模型响应到达时读取配置的网关响应头，并把后端池、上游模型或请求标识关联到会话；会话面板显示这些字段并标明它们属于请求级来源。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1020-1085","lib/index.js:1808-1880"]}
{"unit_id":"Mizumic__dsh-system-fingerprint#feature-3","repo":"Mizumic/dsh-system-fingerprint","commit":"4286e01e6e1f621fe09c03f79b2c4d6c36860037","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-system-fingerprint 的「响应元数据存证」：宿主拦截模型响应的副本，解析模型、指纹和溯源字段，并维护本地元数据与端点登记。可配置原始响应字节存储；默认只记录元数据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1020-1085","lib/index.js:2112-2140"]}
{"unit_id":"Mizumic__dsh-system-fingerprint#feature-4","repo":"Mizumic/dsh-system-fingerprint","commit":"4286e01e6e1f621fe09c03f79b2c4d6c36860037","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-system-fingerprint 的「会话状态接口」：浏览器徽标请求 GET /api/system-fingerprint/state，取得当前会话的模型、指纹或网关溯源结果，并呈现在标题栏和详情浮层。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2090-2110","lib/client.js:700-730"]}
